{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S01、S05等短停留段的静态感受词仍然偏密，部分意象连续堆叠，容易分散注意力；X在这类段落的简洁度更好。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的核心优势是把叙事句拆得更短，并用【】突出每段真正需要抓住的心理变化，扫屏时更容易迅速定位重点；小字感受与音乐节点同步出现，也让观众不必一次处理全部信息。更重要的是，它把人物从害怕给对方负担、因对方没有退开而放松、逐渐产生相互依靠的期待，到害怕失去、最终接受不确定性的心理过程呈现得更细，音乐的力度、音色、呼吸感和情绪转折也有更具体的对应。虽然局部略显拥挤，但整体上Y给观众的信息层次和情感体验更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c03556bb-4b5a-4db0-b51c-289e0ebb615a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T045428999734Z", "elapsed_seconds": 117.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:56:26.423093+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "97d57a32a12496eff4c6603eb666c08c7ad0ac9377ed39dcc863e5e794de78e6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 